  "whatsapp": "<div data-testid="header-action"></div><div class="flex min-h-full flex-col"><div class="flex-1 px-4 pb-4 pt-4"><h2 class="truncate text-xl font-bold leading-tight text-ink">יוסי אברהם</h2><div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium bg-yellow-50 text-yellow-700 border-yellow-200"><span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-yellow-500"></span>בטיפול</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium border-error-border bg-error-bg text-error-text">מעקב באיחור</span></div><!--$--><section dir="rtl" data-testid="lead-provenance-mobile" data-source-visual="whatsapp" class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span class="flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#25D366]/10" aria-hidden="true"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white size-5 bg-[#25D366] " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/whatsapp.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/whatsapp.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div></span><h2 class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-base font-semibold leading-snug break-words text-ink">הליד הזה הגיע אליך אוטומטית מ־WhatsApp</h2></div><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed break-words text-gray-600">SocialCRM קלט את הליד והשיחה ברגע שהלקוח פנה אליך.</p><p dir="auto" class="mt-3 line-clamp-2 break-words rounded-md border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-700">היי, אשמח לפרטים על המבצע</p><div class="mt-3 flex flex-col gap-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-500"><p class="break-words">נקלט אצלך ב־27/10/2026, 11:00</p></div><a class="mt-3 inline-flex min-h-11 w-full items